{"id":"bde974325ff73b34","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-classical-extension.md","title":"经典扩展","display":"df-classical-extension — 经典扩展","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-classical-extension","aliases":["91-df-classical-extension","91-df-classical-closure","91-df-classical-model"],"display":"df-classical-extension — 经典扩展","depends_on":[]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-classical-extension"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-classical-extension</span><span>91-df-classical-closure</span><span>91-df-classical-model</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-classical-extension — 经典扩展"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-classical-extension-—-经典扩展-$\\mathrm{ClExt}$\">df-classical-extension — 经典扩展 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ClExt}\">\\(\\mathrm{ClExt}\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\">\\(\\mathcal L\\)</span> (对象语言)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v:\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}\\to\\{\\mathbf t,\\mathbf f,\\mathbf u\\}\">\\(v:\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}\\to\\{\\mathbf t,\\mathbf f,\\mathbf u\\}\\)</span> (部分评估)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Val}_2(\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\operatorname{Val}_2(\\mathcal L)\\)</span> (满足经典联结词、量词语义的二值评估类)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}classical\\text{-}extension}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ClExt}(v)\\coloneqq\n\\{w\\in\\operatorname{Val}_2(\\mathcal L)\\mid\n\\forall\\varphi\\,\n(v(\\varphi)\\ne\\mathbf u\\rightarrow w(\\varphi)=v(\\varphi))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}classical\\text{-}extension}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ClExt}(v)\\coloneqq\n\\{w\\in\\operatorname{Val}_2(\\mathcal L)\\mid\n\\forall\\varphi\\,\n(v(\\varphi)\\ne\\mathbf u\\rightarrow w(\\varphi)=v(\\varphi))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ClExt}(v)\">\\(\\mathrm{ClExt}(v)\\)</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\">\\(v\\)</span> 的所有经典精确化构成的集合</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\">\\(w\\)</span>：保持 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\">\\(v\\)</span> 已确定真、假值的二值经典评估</li>\n</ul>\n<p>经典扩展的思想：\n把部分评估中尚未确定的原子信息补全，同时保持联结词的经典组合性：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\text{真} \\mapsto \\text{真}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\text{真} \\mapsto \\text{真}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\text{假} \\mapsto \\text{假}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\text{假} \\mapsto \\text{假}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\text{间隙} \\mapsto \\text{由各个经典精确化相容地选择真或假}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\text{间隙} \\mapsto \\text{由各个经典精确化相容地选择真或假}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>经典扩展的两种策略：</p>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"表格\"><table><thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>间隙句子处理</th>\n<th>名称</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>保持已定值</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v(\\varphi)\\ne\\mathbf u\\Rightarrow w(\\varphi)=v(\\varphi)\">\\(v(\\varphi)\\ne\\mathbf u\\Rightarrow w(\\varphi)=v(\\varphi)\\)</span></td>\n<td>每个扩展都必须满足</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>补全未定信息</td>\n<td>对独立的未定原子选择经典值</td>\n<td>选择须组合一致</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div><p>经典扩展与VF理论：\n超赋值语义对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ClExt}(v)\">\\(\\mathrm{ClExt}(v)\\)</span> 中的全部精确化量化。不能把每个间隙句子彼此独立地全部判假或全部判真：例如 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\varphi\">\\(\\neg\\varphi\\)</span> 的值受经典否定约束。</p>\n<p>经典扩展的性质：\n固定点可诱导一个部分评估，但“固定点”本身既不挑出唯一经典扩展，也不保证经典扩展仍是原跳跃算子的固定点。</p>\n<p>经典扩展的意义：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>连接三值逻辑与经典逻辑</li>\n<li>提供经典真理定义的方式</li>\n<li>超赋值理论的技术基础</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-classical-extension-—-经典扩展-$\\mathrm{ClExt}$","text":"df-classical-extension — 经典扩展 $\\mathrm{ClExt}$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{ClExt}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L","display":false},{"tex":"v:\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}\\to\\{\\mathbf t,\\mathbf f,\\mathbf u\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Val}_2(\\mathcal L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}classical\\text{-}extension}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ClExt}(v)\\coloneqq\n\\{w\\in\\operatorname{Val}_2(\\mathcal L)\\mid\n\\forall\\varphi\\,\n(v(\\varphi)\\ne\\mathbf u\\rightarrow w(\\varphi)=v(\\varphi))\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ClExt}(v)","display":false},{"tex":"v","display":false},{"tex":"w","display":false},{"tex":"v","display":false},{"tex":"\\text{真} \\mapsto \\text{真}","display":true},{"tex":"\\text{假} \\mapsto \\text{假}","display":true},{"tex":"\\text{间隙} \\mapsto \\text{由各个经典精确化相容地选择真或假}","display":true},{"tex":"v(\\varphi)\\ne\\mathbf u\\Rightarrow w(\\varphi)=v(\\varphi)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ClExt}(v)","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg\\varphi","display":false}],"bytes":2098,"backlinks":[{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-93","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-classical-extension]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-19","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-CT.md]]\n[[91-df-FS-n.md]]\n[[91-df-FS.md]]\n[[91-df-KF-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-KF.md]]\n[[91-df-T-closure.md]]\n[[91-df-T-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-TB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-TB.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB.md]]\n[[91-df-VF.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions.md]]\n[[91-df-arithmetical-hierarchy.md]]\n[[91-df-capture-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-classical-extension.md]]\n[[91-df-compositional-axioms.md]]\n[[91-df-compositional-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-conjunction-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-conservative-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-conservativity-proof.md]]\n[[91-df-consistency-predicate.md]]\n[[91-df-continuity.md]]\n[[91-df-diagonal-function.md]]\n[[91-df-diagonal-lemma-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-disquotational-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-disquotational-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-expressive-completeness.md]]\n[[91-df-external-consistency.md]]\n[[91-df-external-logic.md]]\n[[91-df-external-negation.md]]\n[[91-df-extrinsic-fixed-point.md]]\n[[91-df-fixed-point-model.md]]\n[[91-df-gap-sentence.md]]\n[[91-df-global-T-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-global-reflection.md]]\n[[91-df-ground-language.md]]\n[[91-df-ground-model.md]]\n[[91-df-hierarchical-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-hierarchy-of-truth-theories.md]]\n[[91-df-implication-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-induction-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-inner-outer-logic-difference.md]]\n[[91-df-internal-consistency.md]]\n[[91-df-internal-induction.md]]\n[[91-df-internal-logic.md]]\n[[91-df-internal-negation.md]]\n[[91-df-intrinsic-fixed-point.md]]\n[[91-df-iterative-construction.md]]\n[[91-df-jump-operator.md]]\n[[91-df-language-with-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-liar-sentence.md]]\n[[91-df-local-T-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-local-reflection.md]]\n[[91-df-maximal-fixed-point.md]]\n[[91-df-minimal-fixed-point.md]]\n[[91-df-model-theory-truth.md]